#: lib/retro_hex_chat/commands/handlers/cs.ex:29
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Manage channel registration and access lists through ChanServ.\nSubcommands: register, drop, info, language <code|none>, category <name|none>, sop/aop/vop add|del|list, help. Must be in a channel.\nAccess hierarchy: SOP (super-operator) > AOP (auto-operator) > VOP (auto-voice).\nRegister requires channel operator. Drop, language and category require being the channel founder."
msgstr ""
"Kanalregistrierung und Zugriffslisten über ChanServ verwalten.\n"
"Unterbefehle: register, drop, info, language <code|none>, category <name|none>, sop/aop/vop add|del|list, help. Nur in einem Kanal möglich.\n"
"Zugriffshierarchie: SOP (Super-Operator) > AOP (Auto-Operator) > VOP (Auto-Voice).\n"
"Register erfordert Kanal-Operator-Rechte. Drop, language und category erfordern, dass du Gründer des Kanals bist."

